# ITEM COPY: fields and notes, SERIALNO blank, a new ID.  Both memos
# are cleared again afterwards for the notes tests below.
> ITEM NOTES 2 ADD="copied note"
< +OK
> ITEM COPY 2
< +OK ID=4
> ITEM NOTES 4
< +DATA
< L copied note
< .
> ITEM SET 2 NOTES=""
< +OK
> ITEM SET 4 NOTES=""
