# A memo line is cut once PROTO_MEMOLINE bytes have been written, each
# backslash counting as the two bytes it is written as.
> ITEM NOTES 1 ADD="abcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghij"
< +OK
> ITEM NOTES 1 ADD="aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"
< +OK
> ITEM NOTES 1
< +DATA
< L abcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghij
< L abcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghij
< L aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\
< L \\\\\\\\\\
< .

# ITEM LIST: default fields, FIELDS= (at most ENG_MAXFSPEC characters
# naming at most ENG_MAXRWIDTH characters of fields), filters and orders.
> ITEM LIST
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL WORKS QTY AVAIL LOC_ID LOC_NAME STATUS
< R 1 SYS "" Portable ? 3 Y 0 "" A
< R 2 CARD IBM "5150 CGA" ? 2 Y 1 "Shelf A1" A
< R 4 CARD IBM "5150 CGA" ? 2 Y 1 "Shelf A1" A
< .
> ITEM LIST FIELDS=ITEM_ID,SERIALNO,ACQ_PRICE
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID SERIALNO ACQ_PRICE
< R 1 "" ""
< R 2 SN-0001 12.50
< R 4 "" 12.50
< .
> ITEM LIST FIELDS=item_id,descr
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID DESCR
< R 1 ""
< R 2 "Colour graphics adapter"
< R 4 "Colour graphics adapter"
< .
> ITEM LIST FIELDS=NOTES
< -ERR 102 memo fields cannot be listed FIELD=NOTES
